# RDE MCP server (in-repo)

When adding or changing MCP-related code under `mcp/` or extending `server.js` for agent-facing APIs:

## Scope

Expose tools for: **supervisorctl state** (and optional start/stop/restart), **Docker** container list and optional lifecycle actions, **Fundbox service logs** under `/opt/fundbox/logs/`, and **read-only system metrics** (load, memory, disk, uptime).

## Reuse

Prefer extracting shared logic from `server.js` (`runLocal`, supervisor parsing, log allowlist, docker JSON lines) instead of forking behavior.

## Safety

- Read-only by default; name mutating tools clearly (`restart_supervisor_service`, not `run_command`).
- Log access: allowlist `/opt/fundbox/logs/` only; reject path traversal.
- Do not add an unrestricted shell MCP tool without explicit product need and hard limits.

## Alignment

Paths and RDE semantics match `.cursor/rules/rde.mdc`. Edit sources locally; deploy via normal RDE sync — do not SSH-edit on the server for app code.
